#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:127
#: 7f70c716befa4c5cabc36e47f5236132
msgid "Analog input pins"
msgstr "模拟输入引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:129
#: eec1351613dc4375b2c13e4f87321bfd
msgid ""
"Pin 0 to 8: The APM2 has a row of analog input pins down one side, labelled "
"A0 to A8 on the underside of the board. These are available as pin numbers 0"
" to 8 inclusive in PIN variables."
msgstr "引脚 0 至 8：APM2 一侧有一排模拟输入引脚，板底面标记为 A0 至 A8。在 PIN 变量中可用引脚编号为 0 至 8（含）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:133
#: 0d1cb787f58c437f9eb7aa784b2595ab
msgid ""
"All these pins can take up to 5V and may be used for any general analog "
"input. They are commonly used for airspeed and sonar inputs."
msgstr "这些引脚均可承受最高 5V 电压，可用于任何通用模拟输入。通常用于空速和声纳输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:136
#: 1f42d72c316646b9b9f4045e6b9d3b8f
msgid ""
"Pin 12: power management connector current pin, accepts up to 5V, usually "
"attached to 3DR power brick with 17:1 scaling"
msgstr "引脚 12：电源管理连接器电流引脚，最高接受 5V，通常连接 3DR 电源模块，缩放比为 17:1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:139
#: 4ac98acfc64849908a9a909d43dd9a57
msgid ""
"Pin 13: power management connector voltage pin, accepts up to 5V, usually "
"attached to 3DR power brick with 10.1:1 scaling"
msgstr "引脚 13：电源管理连接器电压引脚，最高接受 5V，通常连接 3DR 电源模块，缩放比为 10.1:1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:146
#: 25e3f2329c4d422ea36dd8da841dd266
msgid "Digital output pins"
msgstr "数字输出引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:148
#: a6076e5490874bd2980b9ba37a58dca4
msgid ""
"The APM2 uses the same set of 9 analog input pins as digital output pins. "
"They are configured as digital output pins automatically when you start to "
"use them as digital outputs."
msgstr "APM2 使用与数字输出引脚相同的一组 9 个模拟输入引脚。当开始将其用作数字输出时，它们会自动配置为数字输出引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:152
#: 512d97df21e74eec96d7d23d5518564a
msgid ""
"Pin 54 to 62: You need to add 54 to the pin number to convert from an analog"
" pin number to a digital pin number. So pin 54 is digital output pin on the "
"A0 connector. Pin 58 is A4 etc."
msgstr ""
"引脚 54 至 62：需要在模拟引脚编号上加 54 以转换为数字引脚编号。因此引脚 54 是 A0 连接器上的数字输出引脚，引脚 58 是 "
"A4，依此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:156
#: daf1875b80624ea390be8b6ac8260c30
msgid ""
"These pins are usually used with the RELAY_PIN to RELAY_PIN4 parameters, "
"allowing you to control things like camera shutter, bottle drop etc. They "
"are also used as sonar \"stop\" pins allowing you to have multiple sonars "
"and not have them interfere with each other."
msgstr ""
"这些引脚通常与 RELAY_PIN 至 RELAY_PIN4 "
"参数配合使用，允许您控制相机快门、投弹等。它们也用作声纳「停止」引脚，使您可以使用多个声纳而不互相干扰。"

